  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The main goal of our project is to study the complex biogeochemical processes governing the carbon and sulfur cycle in sea ice. Therefore, a whole set of physico-chemical and biological parameters is collected, including ice texture and delta oxygen-18. Delta oxygen-18 helps us to clearly identify the different ice textures observed with the thin sections."
